OL,3,GNEWSAMackintosh Hill House goes 'naked'
OL,4,Afor first time in 122 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharles Rennie Mackintosh's Hill House
OL,7,Fhas been exposed in its naked brickwork
OL,8,Ffor the first time since it was built,
OL,9,Fin a conservation "milestone" to save
OL,10,Fthe property.
OL,12,FNational Trust for Scotland (NTS) said
OL,13,Fthe roughcast removal will now allow
OL,14,Fexperts to make the 122-year-old
OL,15,Fbuilding watertight.
OL,17,FThe property, in Helensburgh in Argyll
OL,18,Fand Bute, is considered to be the
OL,19,FGlasgow artist's most complete example
OL,20,Fof a domestic home.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
