OL,3,GNEWSAMackintosh Hill House goes 'naked'
OL,4,Afor first time in 122 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Portland cement render was applied to
OL,7,Fthe building in 1904, under
OL,8,FMackintosh's instruction, but it ended
OL,9,Fup soaked by the driving rain of
OL,10,FScotland's west coast.
